  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COOTHEMUKI - Rehabilitation of Tea Plantations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Tea.Beneficiaries: 1115 (123 women).Description: The group seeks to production and improve the quality of their tea through rehabilitation of 171 hectares of land, establishment of a nursery to supply new farmers with seedlings, acquire trucks to improve the timeliness of delivery of tea to the factory, and provide motorcycles to their extension agents to improve the quality of services to members.</narrative>
  </description>
